{
  "id": "pokemon-tcg-gym",
  "name": "Pokémon TCG Gym",
  "category": "program",
  "description": {
    "text": "Promos with the Pokémon TCG Gym stamp, given at Pokémon card gyms in two places.\n\nIn Malaysia, Singapore and later the Philippines, Gym shops give out English cards reprinted with the stamp, keeping their original's number, as participation prizes while stocks last; they come from Present Packs. Gym Series One reprints cards of the first Scarlet & Violet sets and a few Sword & Shield cards, Gym Series Two cards of later Scarlet & Violet sets, and Gym Series Three, announced for Gym shops from 1 June 2026, cards of the Mega Evolution base set and late Scarlet & Violet sets. Some are holo or cosmos holo.\n\nIn mainland China, gym events began with the launch of the Simplified Chinese game on 28 October 2022: taking part at a certified Pokémon card gym (宝可梦卡牌道馆) earned a gym event special pack (道馆活动特别包) holding one gym promo at random. A second wave followed in February 2023. The gym promos are SM-P 001 to 012 and 019 to 030.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon TCG Asia: Release of New GYM Promo Cards (Wayback Machine copy, 18 June 2026)",
